The ID is the UUID the service assigned. Everything is recovered from the service.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** the service has no update for technology profile entries; a tenant answered a
  `PATCH` on a key characteristic rating with 400 V101 ("The operation for this entity is not
  allowed").
- **Provider:** the specification documents a `PATCH` for this entity, but its update body has
  no field for a style link, so every change replaces the entry.

